## A hidden IR argument a front end describes with an artificial variable -
## a Fortran CHARACTER length, Swift type metadata - resolves to that variable,
## labelled as artificial; a struct whose type DWARF gives no members for, as
## Swift's, is one opaque field of its size.

REQUIRES: x86-registered-target
RUN: split-file %s %t
RUN: opt -passes='module(sancov-module)' -sanitizer-coverage-trace-args %t/hidden.ll -o %t/hidden.bc
RUN: llc -O2 -filetype=obj %t/hidden.bc -o %t/hidden.o
RUN: sancov -symbolize-dataflow %t/hidden.o | FileCheck %s

CHECK:      "summary": "IR argument 0 -> source parameter \"s\" [exact: compiler source map]",
CHECK:      "summary": "IR argument 1 -> artificial variable \".s.len\" [exact: compiler source map]",
CHECK-NEXT: "parameter": {
CHECK-NEXT:   "name": ".s.len",
CHECK-NEXT:   "artificial": true
CHECK-NEXT: },
CHECK:      "summary": "IR argument 2 -> source parameter \"o\" [exact: compiler source map]",
CHECK-NEXT: "parameter": {
CHECK-NEXT:   "name": "o",
CHECK-NEXT:   "number": 2
CHECK-NEXT: },
CHECK-NEXT: "type": "Opaque",
CHECK-NEXT: "pieces": [
CHECK:      "fields": [
CHECK-NEXT:   {
CHECK-NEXT:     "name": "o",
CHECK-NEXT:     "type": "Opaque",
CHECK-NEXT:     "bit_offset": 0,
CHECK-NEXT:     "bit_size": 64,
CHECK-NEXT:     "value_bit_offset": 0

;--- hidden.ll
target triple = "x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu"

define void @f(i32 noundef %s, i64 noundef %len, i64 noundef %o) !dbg !10 {
    #dbg_value(i32 %s, !11, !DIExpression(), !14)
    #dbg_value(i64 %len, !12, !DIExpression(), !14)
    #dbg_value(i64 %o, !13, !DIExpression(), !14)
  ret void, !dbg !14
}

!llvm.dbg.cu = !{!0}
!llvm.module.flags = !{!2, !3}
!0 = distinct !DICompileUnit(language: DW_LANG_C11, file: !1, isOptimized: true, emissionKind: FullDebug)
!1 = !DIFile(filename: "hidden.c", directory: "/")
!2 = !{i32 7, !"Dwarf Version", i32 5}
!3 = !{i32 2, !"Debug Info Version", i32 3}
!4 = !DIBasicType(name: "int", size: 32, encoding: DW_ATE_signed)
!5 = !DIBasicType(name: "long", size: 64, encoding: DW_ATE_signed)
!6 = !DICompositeType(tag: DW_TAG_structure_type, name: "Opaque", file: !1, size: 64, elements: !{})
!7 = !DISubroutineType(types: !8)
!8 = !{null, !4, !6}
!10 = distinct !DISubprogram(name: "f", scope: !1, file: !1, line: 1, type: !7, scopeLine: 1, spFlags: DISPFlagDefinition | DISPFlagOptimized, unit: !0, retainedNodes: !15)
!11 = !DILocalVariable(name: "s", arg: 1, scope: !10, file: !1, line: 1, type: !4)
!12 = !DILocalVariable(name: ".s.len", scope: !10, file: !1, line: 1, type: !5, flags: DIFlagArtificial)
!13 = !DILocalVariable(name: "o", arg: 2, scope: !10, file: !1, line: 1, type: !6)
!14 = !DILocation(line: 1, column: 1, scope: !10)
!15 = !{!11, !12, !13}
